{"asset_key":"timeline/timeline_story_1401010431","episode":"timeline","category":"timeline_story","story_id":"1401010431","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"cinematic_dialogue:2:1410434001:":{"text":"어이! 낙인 찍힌 죄인! 얼른 나와!","source_cn":"有印记的罪人！快滚出来！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0EE64044C2A64315","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"cinematic_dialogue:2:1410434002:":{"text":"전 저를 위해 온 것이 아니에요...","source_cn":"我不是为自己而来的……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x17C51449788E69FC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"cinematic_dialogue:2:1410434003:":{"text":"베스비가 위험해요... 제발요...","source_cn":"贝丝薇快不行了……求你们","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x76E7B0423D97084F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"cinematic_dialogue:2:1410434004:":{"text":"이게 바로 법을 어긴 대가다!","source_cn":"这就是触犯律法的代价！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x80D7E34ED469A5F3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"cinematic_dialogue:2:1410434005:":{"text":"무슨 일인가?","source_cn":"出什么事了？<key:dialog41>","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x86EA49D203F198EC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1410435001:0":{"text":"여왕님의 영광은 영원하리! 근위대장님께 보고드립니다! 이 낙인이 찍힌 평민이 대열에 무모하게 끼어들려고 하는 것을 제가 붙잡았습니다!","source_cn":"女王荣光永存！报告卫队长！这名带印记的平民妄图混入队伍...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFD74C86F1868F943","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1410435002:1":{"text":"저를 위한 게 아니라, 베스비를 위한 거예요. 베스비는 지금 너무 허약한 상태에요. 어쩌면 곧...","source_cn":"我不是为了自己，是贝丝薇。贝丝薇太虚弱了。她快要……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x037B6D3F7EBE6744","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1410435003:1":{"text":"제발 부탁드려요, 경비병 여러분! 베스비에게 자비를 베풀어 주세요!","source_cn":"求求你们了，各位卫兵大人们！给贝丝薇一点怜悯吧！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x61771932570AE04D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1410435004:0":{"text":"직접 가져가라고 해. 대리 수령은 위법인 거 몰라?!","source_cn":"让她自己来取，律法有言，不得代领！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC7A0B81741CE86B8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1410435005:1":{"text":"베스비... 도 낙인이 있어서...","source_cn":"贝丝薇……也身负印记，她——","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC1A7FD1001E02691","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1410435006:0":{"text":"참나! 그럼 더 얘기할 것도 없지! 제사장님께서 아무 이유도 없이, 죄 없는 자를 벌하셨을까 봐?","source_cn":"哼！那还有什么好说的！祭司大人们难道会平白无故地惩罚无...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x533BD077FC0B2E33","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1410435007:0":{"text":"부디 자비를 베풀어 주세요, 경비병님!","source_cn":"给她一点慈悲吧，卫兵大人！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0E2F04F3999034BA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1410435008:1":{"text":"빅샤, 고마워요. 하지만 어쩔 수 없는 것 같네요...","source_cn":"维克莎，多谢你。我已经知道该怎么做了……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2AF0F4E8E72F0E6D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1410435009:0":{"text":"그래, 평민. 일찌감치 단념하는 게 좋아.","source_cn":"没错，平民。早点死心为好。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0A6B85A74E0C7EF5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1410435010:0":{"text":"참, 이따가 그 평민의 위치도 알려주고! 우리가 알아서 잘 처리해 줄 테니까.","source_cn":"对了，待会记得上报她的位置，我们会负责清理。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4EF2690421B342FF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:1410435011:0":{"text":"아뇨, 베스비는 괜찮아요. 아직 버틸 수 있어요... 먼저 가볼게요! 베스비한테 제가 필요하거든요!","source_cn":"不，贝丝薇还好。她还能坚持……我先走了！她现在很需要我！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x57829F2BFA423FDB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:20:1410435012:1":{"text":"당신들... 정말 너무하네요!","source_cn":"你们……太欺负人了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDE3849AC2284E00E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:23:1410435013:0":{"text":"이봐, 교대할 시간이니 준비하도록.","source_cn":"你，时候不早了，准备交接吧。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA2B6D02C9B44BB32","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:24:1410435014:0":{"text":"근위대장님, 저 녀석을 감시하지 않아도 되겠습니까? 만약을 대비해서라도...","source_cn":"卫队长，我们真的不用去盯着那小子吗？以防万一……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9D97CE37AEF3809F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:25:1410435015:0":{"text":"...괜찮다. 내가 알아서 할 테니 넌 가서 쉬도록 해라.","source_cn":"……无事，我稍后再安排。你早点回去休息。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x71133FCED0E37672","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:26:1410435016:0":{"text":"알겠습니다! 여왕님의 영광은 영원하리!","source_cn":"遵命！女王荣光永存！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB0F14F9E84621734","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:28:1410435017:0":{"text":"줄을 똑바로 서서 한 명씩 받아 가도록!","source_cn":"都排好队，一个一个来领取！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x631B897D98B30B62","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:31:1410435018:0":{"text":"어?! 저거 인듀어아이가?! 다들 줄 똑디 서라!","source_cn":"是因度厄！大家该排队的好好排队……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3D1F94BFC42CBB3E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:32:1410435019:1":{"text":"인듀어 근위대장이 오셨다!","source_cn":"因度厄卫队长来了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC3433592303C7E23","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"cinematic_dialogue:35:1410436001:":{"text":"저쪽에 줄을 선 사람도... 낙인이 있는 것 같은데","source_cn":"那个排队的人……好像也有印记","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xA73FF18878086155","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"저쪽에 줄을 선 사람도... 낙인이 있는 것 같은데","female":"저쪽에 줄을 선 사람도... 낙인이 있는 것 같은데","variant_male_record_index":"158497","variant_female_record_index":"158498","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"cinematic_dialogue:35:1410436002:":{"text":"모두 다 받을 수 있으니, 질서를 지키도록!","source_cn":"保持秩序！大家都能分到","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCDA573E4A492F2B7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"cinematic_dialogue:35:1410436003:":{"text":"인듀어, 넌 대체 어떤 사람이지?","source_cn":"因度厄，你到底是什么样的人？","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xFCDABE8EB79AF8DF","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"인듀어, 넌 대체 어떤 사람이지?","female":"인듀어, 넌 대체 어떤 사람이지?","variant_male_record_index":"158499","variant_female_record_index":"158500","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"cinematic_dialogue:35:1410436004:":{"text":"나도... 받으러 가 봐야겠어","source_cn":"也许……我该试试","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xB3CFF309C562E0E6","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"나도... 받으러 가 봐야겠어","female":"나도... 받으러 가 봐야겠어","variant_male_record_index":"158501","variant_female_record_index":"158502","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"narration:36:1410437001:0":{"text":"내 징벌의 낙인을 보고도 별다른 반응을 보이지 않은 인듀어 덕분에 무난히 다른 평민들과 함께 줄을 서서 은혜의 이슬을 손에 넣을 수 있었다.","source_cn":"你跟随着其他平民排队领取恩典灵露，因度厄似乎对你不加掩...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC5018ADB15C313E5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"narration:37:1410437002:0":{"text":"은혜의 이슬에서 느껴지는 특수한 마력은... 아주 미미하긴 하지만 장기적으로 사용할 경우, 죄악화에 맞설 수 있는 능력이 생기게 될 것이다.","source_cn":"你探查这份灵露，发现其中蕴含了特殊的魔力……虽然含量很...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3A6F31D9BBF18745","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"narration:38:1410437003:0":{"text":"사람들이 선 줄을 자세히 관찰해 본 결과, 징벌의 낙인이 찍힌 평민도 똑같이 은혜의 이슬을 받아 가는 것을 볼 수 있었다... 인듀어는 일부러 모두에게 나눠주는 듯 보였다.","source_cn":"随后你仔细观察着队伍，同样有一些身负惩罚印记的平民获取...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x345FFC1EEB0E73FF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"cinematic_dialogue:40:1410438001:":{"text":"아니... 이 사람은...","source_cn":"不……这个人他……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA12721A4CF0E8251","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"cinematic_dialogue:40:1410438002:":{"text":"살려주세요! 죄악화된 자예요!","source_cn":"救命！是孽化者！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x94C7AE041B1E7709","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"cinematic_dialogue:40:1410438003:":{"text":"모두 도망가세요! 어서!","source_cn":"所有人撤离！快！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3F0C058A42DEC2D1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"cinematic_dialogue:40:1410438004:":{"text":"아니! 저건 케이든이야!","source_cn":"不！那是凯登！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE5CC4CC4D3892848","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:44:1410439001:0":{"text":"제발 케이든을 해치지 말아 주세요! 케이든은 착한 아이예요!","source_cn":"不要伤害凯登！他是个好孩子！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x486697EDCDFEF79D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:45:1410439002:0":{"text":"가까이 오지 마세요! 이미 죄악화되었습니다! 모두의 안전을 위해...","source_cn":"别过来！他已经孽化了！为了你们的安全——","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x91F1B922528A6749","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:46:1410439003:1":{"text":"이게 다 느그 잘못 아이가?! 처음엔 베스비였다가, 인자는 케이든까지... 느그가 저래 만들었다 아이가!","source_cn":"都是你们的错！是你们害的！先是贝丝薇，又是凯登！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0877928701B835F6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:47:1410439004:1":{"text":"그 무기로 뭐 할라고? 목이라도 칠라고?!","source_cn":"你拿着武器，要做什么？是不是要斩下他们的头颅！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x306495E9358A91A9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:50:1410439005:1":{"text":"살인범! 살인마!","source_cn":"杀人犯！刽子手！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2896D7D024E2B776","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:51:1410439006:1":{"text":"우리가 셀로클랜드에 얼마나 많은 희생을 했는데! 이건 아이지! 진짜 있는 거 없는 거 다 바쳤다 아이가! 근데? 와... 우리한테 돌아오는 게 꼴랑 이거가?!","source_cn":"我们为萨洛克兰付出了很多！不……我们付出了一切！然而这...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"